## What I Learned

### Supply Chains Require Strategic Thinking

Operational success depends on balancing supplier relationships, inventory management, financial decisions, and customer expectations.

### Crisis Simulations Improve Decision-Making

Practicing difficult business scenarios in a risk-free environment helps build stronger leadership skills.

### AI Supports Executive Decisions

AI can organize complex operational data into actionable insights, enabling faster and more informed business decisions.

### Dashboards Enhance Operational Visibility

Visualizing key metrics makes it easier to identify bottlenecks, evaluate strategies, and improve organizational resilience.

